Are you happy with your video background? Does it convey what you want it to convey about you?

If you’ve been thinking about making some changes, let’s make that day today!

🚀 **Tip of the Day:** You don’t need much to create a professional, personable background. Check out the image below detailing how I set mine up.

Now let’s switch directions, and take a look at what I see during my video calls to ensure I’m making the best virtual impression possible.

You don’t need to pull out all the bells and whistles for a solid setup. I’ve equipped myself with the essentials while also making sure I’m not buying tools that break the bank. Here’s mine below.

